From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shell32: link path resolution, stock icon, associated icon fallbacks, shell ordinals (2048)

shell32: link path resolution, stock icon and associated icon fallbacks, shell ordinals.

IShellLink::SetPath finds a program by name (adding .exe, .bat and the other
program extensions, on the path) and keeps the drive letter a capital;
SHGetStockIconInfo clears the index fields for an unknown icon;
ExtractAssociatedIcon falls back to shell32's own icon and says so in the
path and index. New: SHLocalAlloc/Free/ReAlloc, AddCommasW, ShortSizeFormatW,
SHIsBadInterfacePtr, DragQueryFileAorW, SheRemoveQuotes, SheFullPath,
SheShortenPath, SheGetCurDrive and PathProcessCommand (A and W). They were
stubs or fell short.
---
